#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:6
msgid "$foreach"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$foreach(name,code,separator=\"; \")**"
msgstr "用法：**$foreach(name,code,separator=\"; \")**"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:9
msgid "Category: loop"
msgstr "类别：循环"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.3"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.3"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:14
msgid "Iterates over each element found in the multi-value variable ``name``, executing ``code`` during each iteration. Before each iteration, the element value is first stored in the variable ``_loop_value`` and the count is stored in the variable ``_loop_count``. This allows the element or count value to be accessed within the code script."
msgstr ""
"对多值变量 ``name`` 中的每个元素进行迭代，并在每次迭代期间执行 ``code``。在每"
"次迭代之前，元素值首先存储在变量 ``_loop_value`` 中，计数存储在变量 "
"``_loop_count`` 中。这允许在代码脚本中访问元素或计数值。"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:16
msgid "A literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for ``name``, using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued variable."
msgstr ""
"可以用表示多值的字面值替换 ``name`` ，使用 ``separator`` （如果没有传递，则使用"
"分号后跟空格 \"; \"）将值强制转换为适当的多值变量。"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:19
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_foreach.rst:21
msgid "The following statements will perform the processing indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将执行所指示的处理："
